{"asset_key":"mn3/quest_story_10132200","episode":"mn3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"10132200","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:0:1013220001:0":{"text":"저 왔어요! 나쁜 사람한테 잡혀서 감옥에 갇혔어요... 걱정 끼쳐서 죄송합니다!","source_cn":"我回来啦！我不小心被坏人关起来了……抱歉，让大家替我担心了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDA7C932B0FE5BAF8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:1:1013220002:0":{"text":"페이, 무사히 돌아와서 다행이야. 곧 먼 여정을 떠나야 하니까 에너지를 아껴두는 게 좋을 거야.","source_cn":"菲，看到你回来，我们总算放心了。马上要长途跋涉，你要保...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB795FF5D2B9DD794","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1013220003:0":{"text":"먼 여정이요? 아아, 석각 유적에 가서 고대 보석의 냄새를 확인해 드리기로 했는데... 하마터면 잊을 뻔했어요.","source_cn":"长途跋涉？差点忘了。我得赶去石刻遗址那边，帮助几位学者...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB300385C7E595E8A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1013220004:0":{"text":"페이가 무사히 돌아왔으니까 저도 이만 가야겠어요... 헤어지려니 좀 아쉽네요.","source_cn":"既然菲被安全找回来，我也差不多该回家了……竟然有点舍不得呢。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDC95E3478EDE6C9F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:菲":{"text":"페이","source":"菲","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:冬青学者雅莉":{"text":"상록수 학자 아리","source":"冬青学者雅莉","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:梅瑞特":{"text":"메린","source":"梅瑞特","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":5,"localized_text_count":4,"speaker_count":3}}